{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "45a21b157739354658b39a88e03f69cf6bcd74b96c11906d41331e1ed28665aa", "ja": "2nd Track　この指とまれ", "zh": "2nd Track　停在这只手指上", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c328467b9f220b0ae6224530b193050447ae48fe8ab0d128575a089856aa7a47", "ja": "ピアノを始めた恵美は、驚きの上達ぶりを見\nせる。丁度いいとバンドの話を持ち掛けるプ\nロデューサー。ジュリアの勧めもあり恵美は\n承諾。同じ初心者の可奈も参加し……その時\nビートを刻みながら、亜利沙が現れた！", "zh": "开始学钢琴的惠美展现出惊人的进步。制作人觉得时机正好，向她提起了组建乐队的事。受到茱莉亚的推荐，惠美答应了。与她一样是初学者的可奈也加入进来……就在这时，亚利沙一边打着节拍一边出现了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1000_se", "source_sha256": "3f1439f47e55d0675f26c3c899e54dba2a66cf1502605d7e098bdeff27d796c2", "ja": "ポロン……ポロン……", "zh": "叮咚……叮咚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b4f68c9eb5e678601b4219d7795aa707f303219758a1ff1c1a2cacb9d3ce5756", "ja": "（ピアノの音がする……恵美が練習してるのかな？\nせっかくだし、ちょっと様子を覗いてみるか）", "zh": "（听到钢琴声了……是惠美在练习吗？难得有这个机会，要不要去稍微看看情况。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "e312f7e474262ee5333e7bdc39c537ebd2822b4317e41ffb642eea73b22eee05", "ja": "ううっ、ダメだ～！　最後のほうとかもう無理矢理\n弾いてたから、運指がめちゃくちゃだったよ～……。", "zh": "呜呜，不行啊～！最后那段根本就是勉强弹下来的，指法完全乱套了啦～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "6cdb1ab25019e41a73b2b1396a6080c8ee3290fee889e83b3cd7fc548cad123a", "ja": "やっぱり、小指と薬指が課題ですね。\nこればっかりは、反復練習で鍛えていくしか……。", "zh": "果然小指和无名指还是个课题呢。\n唯独这个，只能通过反复练习来锻炼了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1004_se", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5ee5624f4207162e6848e1bd622a7fcdf18fd7cd18c0ae19ec17f7e2ec439ca5", "ja": "お疲れさま！　恵美、すごいじゃないか。\n短期間で、ずいぶん弾けるようになったんだな！", "zh": "辛苦了！惠美，真厉害啊。\n这么短的时间里，已经进步这么多了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "e19b14a57782ff93033abaeaf42925a778a7438fa8dd5154d25a647c74de2983", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\n今の聞いてたの？　恥ずかしいなぁ、もう……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n刚才的你都听到了吗？真是的，好难为情啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c6f137ee4009a88e12488198763d849980c017f070abc208f1e45565442135c6", "ja": "いや、ちゃんと曲になってたよ。\nやっぱり本人にやる気があると違うな！", "zh": "不，已经像一首完整的曲子了。\n果然，自己有干劲就是不一样啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "1e96b31e5a9f779fb012299d4cf916179e9983d90598585714079da3dbf2b819", "ja": "うん……まぁ、始めてみたら楽しくなっちゃったしね。\nレッスンルームが空いてる時間、ずっと弾いてるかも。", "zh": "嗯……嘛，开始弹了之后就觉得挺开心的了。\n练习室空着的时候，我可能一直在弹呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "627cbd1e4c879dbb66f123727ed6fd596438450a104c5d6f1785f5aced60cf70", "ja": "それに、ジュリアと静香も練習見てくれるし……。\nホントありがとね、ふたりとも。", "zh": "而且，茱莉亚和静香也会来看我练习……。\n真的很感谢你们，两位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "aeae51e1366f9201290da36b3a4002f3ab23e7b0c8492ef63b0a88d900e435c6", "ja": "いいえ。けど恵美さん、本当に上手になりましたね。\n発表会でもあれば、いい目標になると思うんですけど。", "zh": "不用客气。不过惠美，你真的弹得很好了呢。\n要是有个成果发表会的话，我觉得也能当个不错的目标。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "16e42e0275a9ff419c839010c86842907e210c0122b26ccb8de066855028fcb1", "ja": "いや～アタシのピアノなんて、\nまだ全然、人に聞かせられるレベルじゃないっしょ！", "zh": "哎呀～我的钢琴水平嘛，还完全没到能弹给别人听的程度啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "7b0748399e1b3d52c525c906accc9333644d7fe0fef918b04e47b7e1046cadfa", "ja": "いや、レベルどうこうの前に、人前で演奏する機会は\n作っておいたほうがいいと思うぜ。", "zh": "不，先别管水平怎么样，我觉得还是尽量多创造些在人前演奏的机会比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "d672f6a2c6cca47483970e648e35dd6c5fcba5bd259161b905a7beb4354d61b4", "ja": "「もっとうまくなったら」……なんて言ってたら、\n一生かかっても、満足するレベルに達しないからな。", "zh": "要是想着“等弹得更好一些之后”……\n那一辈子都达不到让自己满意的水平了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "b308344a62c299a60150b1c370c5abd2a6540e193495670f760e8675d15a2a29", "ja": "そういうもんなんだね～。", "zh": "原来是这么回事啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "410ea8a22b202489c7582131ce1c8116573eb486b03113efc6cf7e7252f73dd7", "ja": "それなら、ちょうどいい話があるんだけど……。\n恵美、バンドをやってみないか？", "zh": "那样的话，我正好有件合适的事想跟你说……  \n惠美，要不要试试看组乐队？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "caa231a88b397877d9e1da0f3be7164ee10ea304674432c7aeea2a53ef679234", "ja": "バンド！？　え、アタシがバンドって……\nピアノでってこと！？", "zh": "乐队！？诶，要我组乐队……  \n是要弹钢琴吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "eb97fb06227d5688f302dae9a87cde650fa5f884b2da38ceab6399bbcf902c16", "ja": "そうだ。ちょうど社長から、バンド系のユニットは\nどうかっていう提案があったんだけど……。", "zh": "没错。社长刚好提议过，要不要组建一支乐队风格的组合……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f350254b1e0cbac3e1f6baeffde837a2925a5bf49d136d1167a048f60c8be220", "ja": "バンドを組めば練習相手もできるし、\nライブで腕前を披露する事もできる。どうだ？", "zh": "组建乐队的话，既能有一起练习的伙伴，也能在演出中展示本领。怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "94a1beb8fce5c4f0708e76d2e169317aff5d15f05283cd78c8eeae4caee328f3", "ja": "いいね、{$P$}！\n妙案だと思うぜ。", "zh": "不错啊，{$P$}！\n我觉得是个好主意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "43a78cd166eeafffb31349fc430a05dde05f4dfb84dbcc989e66b5667cdb30e9", "ja": "恵美さんも、クラシックよりポップス寄りの曲を\n弾くほうが好きみたいですし。いいんじゃないですか？", "zh": "惠美也好像比起古典乐，更喜欢弹\n偏流行风格的曲子。我觉得挺好的呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "f4d6dd73c3f230147e7b771792025dd8972b8165dd98902aef2e2365f63d1e2b", "ja": "いやいや！　そんな、急にバンドなんて無理だって！\nアタシまだ初心者だし、足引っ張っちゃうってば～。", "zh": "不行不行！怎么能突然组乐队啊，这也太勉强了！\n我才刚入门，绝对会拖后腿的啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "ba03a088f7a6a1b82d90a453c9ed943272e039974059ee5bbc5cd124bcff8672", "ja": "だったら、同じ初心者と組めばいいんですよ。\nそれならお互い、プレッシャーも感じないと思います。", "zh": "那就和同样是新手的人组队不就好了吗？  \n这样一来，我想彼此都不会感到压力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "abdeb0d5a23ab7a90bbe797e39f6363898f723e77bedaeece5f03641f921b645", "ja": "なるほど……そういうことなら、あたしに\n心当たりがあるぜ。みんな、ちょっと待っててくれ！", "zh": "原来如此……既然这样，我倒是有个合适的人选。大家，稍微等我一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "90170b1a80cbb3d28d41b0c0aa8be1d9629be778864861c97e7588aef1c36c05", "ja": "あっ、ジュリア！？　……行っちゃったな。\nしかし、心当たりっていうのは一体……？", "zh": "啊，茱莉亚！？……走掉了啊。\n不过，他说的“想到一个人”到底是怎么回事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "90d8c0213da97f6c804c0eddfce04a6bb9b4f6b2b194cea1bd84ad02081c6ee6", "ja": "みんな、お待たせ！\n連れてきたぜ、あたしの一番弟子ってやつだ♪", "zh": "大家，久等啦！\n我带来了哦，也就是我的大弟子啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "153548b40e2df4de620212c55105dad4dd00a5b799cae570ba888fc00d9ec730", "ja": "や、矢吹可奈でしゅっ！！\nしょ、初心者ですがどうぞよろしく……。", "zh": "我、我是矢吹可奈！！\n虽、虽然是新手，但还请多关……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "6fb4d1db2a7a4d6d8dd1b50b782af3a5f063588e604243b6fe0691a5324f08e4", "ja": "って、恵美さんと静香ちゃんじゃないですか！\nあ、{$P$}さんも、お疲れさまです♪", "zh": "啊，这不是惠美姐和静香嘛！\n啊，{$P$}先生也辛苦啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "033fce004227dc460f0f60fede60f233b0fa9f83acff2e6fd061ecc63599e216", "ja": "お疲れさま、可奈！\n……ジュリア、可奈をバンドに？", "zh": "辛苦了，可奈！\n……茱莉亚，要让可奈加入乐队？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "cc5529fdf41c5cdbe117071560f723dc098d6411d948ae440af9262900f694da", "ja": "ああ。ピアノ初心者の恵美と、ギター初心者の可奈。\nバンドを組むにはうってつけだろ？", "zh": "对。钢琴初学者惠美，还有吉他初学者可奈。\n拿来组乐队不是正合适吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "38b6f35f3b860765e97c1960510da56d9101406cf5c695b71965e9804b4e865b", "ja": "ギターの腕は、まあ成長中って感じだけど。\nガッツがあって前向きなところは、買いだと思うぜ！", "zh": "吉他的水平嘛，感觉还在成长中。\n不过她有干劲又乐观，我觉得这点很值得肯定！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1031_020meg", "source_sha256": "42dea666f1642318741c4511d1b010b3fc7a52a23b5d9cafcf0ab704cb6e7542", "ja": "も～、ジュリアってば何も言わないで出てくから、\nドキドキしちゃったよ！　でも、可奈なら安心だね♪", "zh": "真是的～茱莉亚什么都不说就跑出去，\n害我紧张了一下！不过，是可奈的话就放心了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_02_1032_036kan", "source_sha256": "674547d15d1ba4490450309fb48e9092fa64aee82138d927a3d0d836fce454de", "ja": "私もっ！　知らない人とバンドを組むなんて、\nちょっと不安だなって思いましたけど……。", "zh": "我也是！要和不认识的人组乐队，我本来还有点不安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
